config NUCODE_ARDUINO_EVENT_FABRIC
	bool "M25 TIMER·GPIOTE·EGU·DPPI·PPIB 전 instance 후보 API 활성화"
	default n
	depends on NUCODE_ARDUINO_API
	depends on NUCODE_ARDUINO_IO_OWNERSHIP
	depends on NUCODE_ARDUINO_GPIO
	depends on !NUCODE_ARDUINO_INTERRUPTS
	help
	  TIMER00/10/20~24, GPIOTE20/30, EGU10/20, DPPIC00/10/20/30과
	  PPIB00/01/10/11/20/21/22/30의 channel ownership, task/event endpoint,
	  DPPI fan-out과 domain bridge를 제공합니다. GRTC system counter는 기존
	  BoardSystem API가 소유하므로 reset/stop하지 않습니다.
